  "description": "Network utility library for .NET. Provides ARP table queries (GetIPAddresses, GetMacAddress, GetAddressType via the arp command), IPv4 and IPv6 string validation extension methods (IsIpV4, IsIpV6), NetworkInterface extension methods (GetIPv4Addresses, GetIPv6Addresses, GetMacAddress, IsPhysical, IsUp), active interface resolution (NetworkInfo), real-time per-second traffic statistics as IObservable<Traffic> (TrafficMonitor), and a NetworkDeviceInfo model with async DNS and MAC resolution. Depends on System.Reactive.",
